cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "sutra: Variance-Preserving Stage-Wise Multi-Environment Trial Analysis"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Spatially adjusted genotype means from two-dimensional tensor-product
  P-splines are passed to a stage-wise linear mixed model together with their
  full error variance-covariance matrix, rather than as bare point estimates.
authors:
  - family-names: Kumar
    given-names: Praveen
    email: bkpraveenars@gmail.com
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Genetics and Plant Breeding, College of Agriculture,
      Agriculture University Jodhpur, Rajasthan, India
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/BKPRAVEEN/sutra"
keywords:
  - plant breeding
  - multi-environment trials
  - linear mixed models
  - P-splines
  - genotype-by-environment interaction
